{"id":12843,"date":"2025-11-21T09:39:17","date_gmt":"2025-11-21T09:39:17","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=12843"},"modified":"2025-11-21T09:39:17","modified_gmt":"2025-11-21T09:39:17","slug":"nova-generace-multimodalni-spektroskopie-seznamte-se-s-ira-scope","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/nova-generace-multimodalni-spektroskopie-seznamte-se-s-ira-scope\/","title":{"rendered":"Nov\u00e1 generace multimod\u00e1ln\u00ed spektroskopie: seznamte se s IRa-SCOPE"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"205\" data-end=\"644\">Mil\u00ed u\u017eivatel\u00e9! R\u00e1di bychom v\u00e1m p\u0159edstavili <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/ira-scope\/\"><strong data-start=\"219\" data-end=\"232\">IRa-SCOPE<\/strong><\/a> \u2013 pr\u016flomov\u00fd p\u0159\u00edstroj, kter\u00fd posouv\u00e1 materi\u00e1lovou anal\u00fdzu na zcela novou \u00farove\u0148. Umo\u017e\u0148uje komplexn\u00ed spektroskopickou identifikaci chemick\u00e9ho slo\u017een\u00ed s <strong data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"432\">mikro- a\u017e nanometrov\u00fdm prostorov\u00fdm rozli\u0161en\u00edm<\/strong>. IRa-SCOPE propojuje modern\u00ed <strong data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"503\">LDIR reflexn\u00ed absorp\u010dn\u00ed spektroskopii<\/strong>, \u0161pi\u010dkovou <strong data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"550\">konfok\u00e1ln\u00ed Ramanovu mikroskopii<\/strong> a vysoce citliv\u00e9 <strong data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"588\">nano-IR techniky<\/strong> jako nano-FTIR \u010di AFM-IR zobrazov\u00e1n\u00ed a spektroskopii.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"805\">P\u0159ipojte se a zjist\u011bte, jak m\u016f\u017ee tento mikroskop zjednodu\u0161it a urychlit va\u0161e anal\u00fdzy d\u00edky snadno pou\u017eiteln\u00e9mu, v\u00edce\u00farov\u0148ov\u00e9mu korelativn\u00edmu p\u0159\u00edstupu. Webin\u00e1\u0159 se bude konat ve \u010dtvrtek <strong data-start=\"137\" data-end=\"165\">4. prosince 2025 v \u010dasech 10:00\u201311:00 a 17:00\u201318:00 <\/strong>a <a href=\"https:\/\/www.attocube.com\/en\/ressources\/upcoming-webinar-ira-scope?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=Act-On+Software&amp;utm_content=email&amp;utm_term=Register%20Now%21&amp;utm_campaign=Webinar%20IRa-SCOPE%3A%20nano-IR%20%2B%20confocal%20Raman%20in%20a%20single%20instrument%20learn%20what%20it%20can%20do%21\"><strong>registrovat se na n\u011bj m\u016f\u017eete zde<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"841\"><strong data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"841\">Co se na webin\u00e1\u0159i nau\u010d\u00edte:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"962\">jak korelace nano-IR a konfok\u00e1ln\u00ed Ramanovy spektroskopie zlep\u0161uje nano-anal\u00fdzu organick\u00fdch i anorganick\u00fdch materi\u00e1l\u016f<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1008\">jak\u00e9 unik\u00e1tn\u00ed workflow IRa-SCOPE umo\u017e\u0148uje<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1068\">jak\u00e1 je u\u017eivatelsk\u00e1 p\u0159\u00edv\u011btivost a v\u00fdkon syst\u00e9m\u016f neaspec<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1104\"><strong data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1104\">Pro koho je webin\u00e1\u0159 ur\u010den:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1305\">Pro v\u011bdce, in\u017een\u00fdry a vedouc\u00ed laborato\u0159\u00ed, kte\u0159\u00ed pracuj\u00ed v aplikovan\u00e9m v\u00fdzkumu a cht\u011bj\u00ed zv\u00fd\u0161it efektivitu sv\u00e9 pr\u00e1ce pomoc\u00ed pokro\u010dil\u00fdch spektroskopick\u00fdch zobrazovac\u00edch metod, jako je nano-IR nebo AFM-Raman.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1407\">Nem\u016f\u017eete se z\u00fa\u010dastnit \u017eiv\u011b? <strong data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1405\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.attocube.com\/en\/ressources\/upcoming-webinar-ira-scope?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=Act-On+Software&amp;utm_content=email&amp;utm_term=Register%20Now%21&amp;utm_campaign=Webinar%20IRa-SCOPE%3A%20nano-IR%20%2B%20confocal%20Raman%20in%20a%20single%20instrument%20learn%20what%20it%20